WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.927
Before you let an outside engineer near your AI, one question matters most: is my data safe? It should be your first question.

00:07.927 --> 00:19.247
I work in your environment, with your keys, under your rules. Least privilege by default — I only get access to what the work actually needs, and nothing leaves your systems without your say-so.

00:19.247 --> 00:28.524
No training on your data, no shadow copies, no third-party services you didn't approve. Everything is logged, scoped, and revocable the moment we're done.

00:28.524 --> 00:32.368
Your data stays yours — provably, not just as a promise.

00:32.368 --> 00:34.904
Security first, always. Let's talk.

